  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are maximum kinetic energies of photoelectrons emitted when lights of wavelength <math><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively incident on a metallic surface. If&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math> then",
